  "ingredients": [
    "3 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/4 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "2 tablespoon water",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1 cup raspberries",
    "8 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "2 tablespoon stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1 large egg",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 cup stevia/erythritol blend",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1/4 teaspoon sea salt",
    "1/4 cup butter (melted)",
    "1/4 cup sour cream",
    "3 large egg",
    "2 tablespoon unsweetened almond milk",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/2 teaspoon almond extract",
    "1/4 cup almonds (sliced)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all the ingredients. Preheat oven to 350F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grease a springform pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan, add the stevia/erythritol blend and xantham gum.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk in the water and lemon juice.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the raspberries and stir. Bring stovetop to medium heat and let it simmer. Then, reduce heat to low and heat for an additional 5-10 minutes or until it is thick, like syrup.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, add the room temp cream cheese and mix with a mixer. Then, add in the stevia/erythritol blend, egg, and vanilla extract. Mix until combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In another bowl, combine the almond flour, stevia/erythritol, baking soda, and sea salt. Whisk this all together until combined well. Then, whisk in the melted butter.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove a portion of the mixture and save for the streusel topping.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In another bowl, whisk together the sour cream and eggs, one at a time. Then, add the almond milk, vanilla extract, and almond extract. Whisk until combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour this mixture into the dry ingredients. Mix together until combined and spread evenly on the greased springform pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the removed portion of the cake butter and the almonds together in a bowl. Set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the cream cheese mixture to the springform pan leaving 1/2\"-3/4\" from the edge. Then, add the raspberry mixture then the streusel topping.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the oven for 30-40 minutes. The cream cheese mixture in the middle should jiggle a little when done and the edges should be golden brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Raspberry-Cream-Cheese-Coffee-Cake-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool for 15-20 minutes for slicing. Enjoy! Leave leftovers in the refrigerator.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-raspberry-cream-cheese-coffee-cake/#wprm-recipe-53729-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
